ree rejected revisions claimed a complete ratio and the reviewer measured a smaller one; an honest smaller number with named gaps is accepted, an inflated one is a finding.\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 13088,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 3272,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
