e report still proves the barrier. Kill path: the attach succeeds after closure with lost state through the attach dispatch.\",\n+    ),\n+    Mutant(\n+        name=\"N-attach-barrier-boundary-recovery\",\n+        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/state.go\",\n+        find='\\\\t\\\\tboundary := !quiesce && strings.HasPrefix(document.IdempotencyKey, instanceID+\\\"/boundary/\\\")\\\\n',\n+        replace='\\\\t\\\\tboundary := !quiesce && strings.HasPrefix(document.IdempotencyKey, instanceID+\\\"/boundary/\\\") && document.IdempotencyKey != \\\"0198f4c8-8e50-7f66-8f70-222222222221/boundary/0198f4c8-8e50-7f66-8f70-666666666661/ax_checkpoint_boundary\\\"\\\\n',\n+        count=1,\n+        run=\"TestExecuteBoundaryBarrierSurvivesStateWriteFailure\",\n+        expect=\"KILLED\",\n+        note=\"Admits exactly the fixture boundary key past the barrier recovery scan; every other closure report still proves the barrier. Kill path: the attach succeeds after boundary closure with lost state through the attach dispatch.\",\n+    ),\n+    Mutant(\n+        name=\"N-attach-barrier-corrupt-scan\",\n+        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/state.go\",\n+        find='\\\\t\\\\tvar document outcomeDocument\\\\n\\\\t\\\\tif err := json.Unmarshal(raw, &document); err != nil {\\\\n\\\\t\\\\t\\\\treturn false, fmt.Errorf(\\\"decode tmux barrier outcome: %w\\\", err)\\\\n\\\\t\\\\t}\\\\n',\n+        replace='\\\\t\\\\tvar document outcomeDocument\\\\n\\\\t\\\\tif err := json.Unmarshal(raw, &document); err != nil && entry.Name() != \\\"corrupt-barrier-probe.json\\\" {\\\\n\\\\t\\\\t\\\\treturn false, fmt.Errorf(\\\"decode tmux barrier outcome: %w\\\", err)\\\\n\\\\t\\\\t}\\\\n\\\\t\\\\tif err := json.Unmarshal(raw, &document); err != nil {\\\\n\\\\t\\\\t\\\\tcontinue\\\\n\\\\t\\\\t}\\\\n',\n+        count=1,\n+        run=\"TestExecuteAttachErrorsOnCorruptBarrierScan\",\n+        expect=\"KILLED\",\n+        note=\"Admits exactly the killer's corrupt report past the barrier decode arm (skipped instead of errori