{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000da03","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c7e8-b0ce-7b51-a856-c1e5aeba35b8"},"sequence":2908,"recorded_at":1780531400005811,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"1e747257-7dba-4be5-8162-7ca370e28419","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"1e747257-7dba-4be5-8162-7ca370e28419","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"1e747257-7dba-4be5-8162-7ca370e28419"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0c7fb-723b-78a2-886b-6dd2701ae6ca"},"task_id":"01a0c7fb-723b-78a2-886b-6dd2701ae6ca","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0c7fb-723b-78a2-886b-6dd2701ae6ca","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-81-1\",\n  \"command\": \"PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 internal/tmuxserver/mutant_harness.py N-status-attached-exit N-status-foreign-row N-status-panes-unknown-exit N-osrunner-argv-nul N-spawn-root-custody 2>&1 | tail -8\",\n  \"description\": \"Run reviewer-plant harness rows\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"ok: N-status-attached-exit: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly exit 1 past the attached-probe exit arm (reviewer R1); every other nonzero exit still refuses unknown. Kill path: the exit-1 probe with plausible stdout reads a count through the status dispatch. [exit 1]\\nok: N-status-foreign-row: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the \\\"review-foreign-instance\\\" row past the attached-row identity arm (reviewer R2); every other foreign row still skips. Kill path: the foreign row reads a count through the status dispatch. [exit 1]\\nok: N-status-panes-unknown-exit: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly exit 2 past the panes-probe unknown arm (reviewer R3); every other unmarked exit still refuses unknown. Kill path: the exit-2 probe with plausible stdout reads presence through the status dispatch. [exit 1]\\nok: N-osrunner-argv-nul: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the NUL-containing review argument past the execution argv gate (reviewer R4); every other malformed vector still refuses. Kill path: the NUL argument reaches the command builder. [exit 1]\\nok: N-spawn-root-custody: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the root-writability refusal past the spawner custody gate (reviewer R5, corrected); every other custody refusal still refuses, and the helper and Execute sides stay intact. Kill path: the unsafe root spawns. Closes the SPW/B39 custody cell. [exit 1]\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 1385,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 347,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
