ory is missing (corrupt scan and empty time error). Five committed tests, seven narrowing rows.\n+- P1-B: the executed backend restore binds to the decided winner — carried `(lease_id, lease_epoch)` must equal the ordered winner or the entry refuses `local_precondition_failed` at `wrapper restore winner binding` before any effect. Three committed tests (joint + per-arm), two narrowing rows.\n+- P1-C: the refresh bound is enforced, not cooperative — the adapter runs on its own goroutine, the entry takes answer-or-deadline, late answers never verify (nil-error included), with a hook-stalled both-ready race test forcing the window deterministically. Two committed tests plus the reworked bound subtest (shared-var race removed, elapsed tightened 5s→1s), two narrowing rows. Bound B37 states the missing production mesh transport.\n+- R1-R5: exit-1 attached, foreign attached row, exit-2 panes, NUL argv, spawner root custody — five committed clause witnesses plus five harness rows with the reviewer's (corrected R5) plants; the SPW rootwrite cell moves B39→M.\n+- P2-B: Table C 19→18 U2c; totals recomputed by script (238 measured of 4896; 181 bound; 4477 unreachable); resume-reachable status cells U2a/U1→B39 (22 cells); row 83 stale names dropped and the successor order corrected (prior validation precedes effects; successor persists after); intro 92/92; wall-time prose corrected.\n+- P2-A: entry grid over pre-existing tmuxserver+termbind entries (27 keys, zero moves) plus new-entry behavior (27 keys, all ADDED); suite grid over the 34-package closure (23,054 shared keys, zero moves, 476 additions all PASS in tmuxserver+termbind, zero removed); drivers, streams, and diffs in the evidence tarball.\n+- VALIDATION (exit 0, this run): gofmt; build + vet unix and windows; full suite; race on both touched packages; cover (tmuxserver 87.7%, termbind 83.5%); tracecheck; cataloggen clean; harness 251/251 tmuxserver + 40/40 termbind with one raw log per plant.\n+- STATUS: ready for review; worktree intentionally UNCOMMITTED for Story handoff snapshot. Results standalone + matrix + `TASK-260830-1c28dz_rework-evidence-rev4.tar.gz` attached to the board item.\n","final_result":true}}}
